{"id":"97702058-89c8-4c36-8d78-267dbb6fc7bf","name":"Oven-Roasted Chicken Shawarma (NYTimes)","description":"This recipe from Sam Sifton at the NYTimes is so amazing I just had to share it here. Not only is it flavorful but extremely easy - just marinate, roast and serve. It reminded me of the wonderful wraps we enjoyed for lunch on a trip to Israel. The open-air lunch stands included grilled chicken, falafel or lamb wrapped in pita and were served up with crisp cucumbers, tomatoes and a refreshing tzaziki-like white sauce - yum! The chicken should marinate from 1 to 12 hours so plan ahead - very easy to throw together before work and cook up for dinner. While it isn't Israel or cooked on a rotisserie it is certainly delicious and is do-able at home!","webLink":"https://www.recipezazz.com/recipe/oven-roasted-chicken-shawarma-nytimes-25412","baseServings":5,"status":"published","createdBy":"bbb1a187-f92e-434a-bba1-f3e65a37d85a","duplicateOf":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"47033f4a-9302-4fc4-88ff-e0e278bbf74c","recipeId":"97702058-89c8-4c36-8d78-267dbb6fc7bf","ingredient":{"id":"490690c6-0b4b-42bf-a4a5-1db8c7b181b4","name":"lemon","category":"produce","defaultUnit":"whole","createdAt":"2026-03-12T16:26:44.053492Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-12T16:26:44.053492Z"},"originalText":"2 lemons, whole (juiced)","quantity":2,"unit":"whole","status":"approved","matchedIngredient":{"id":"490690c6-0b4b-42bf-a4a5-1db8c7b181b4","name":"lemon","category":"produce","defaultUnit":"whole","createdAt":"2026-03-12T16:26:44.053492Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-12T16:26:44.053492Z"},"suggestedIngredientName":null,"suggestedCategory":null,"suggestedUnit":null,"reviewFlags":[],"createdAt":"2026-05-24T23:52:26.358823Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-24T23:52:26.358823Z"},{"id":"f1e9bbde-0bd6-4989-b9ae-37c33111530f","recipeId":"97702058-89c8-4c36-8d78-267dbb6fc7bf","ingredient":{"id":"96b2eca0-39d6-484f-a654-7a08fe040b3e","name":"olive oil","category":"pantry","defaultUnit":"tbsp","createdAt":"2026-03-14T02:52:11.808164